+**Existing-repository metadata preparation**
+
+Prepare code.json directly and validate it against the named applicable CMS schema.
+Check factual accuracy separately. Use the known destination URL before content
+publication. Do not invent counts, labor, classifications, contract numbers or
+approvals; use only schema-supported unknown values or explicitly authorized
+deferrals. Record snapshot dates and distinguish inventory submission from document
+creation. A generator may be used only from a separately authorized checkout with
+verified ASCII options, version and reviewed hooks; creation hooks must not run in
+an existing repository.

 As you continue development in this repository, it is important to keep this file up-to-date. Our [automated-codejson-generator](https://github.com/DSACMS/automated-codejson-generator) can assist with updating this file.

